$866
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The playbook defines onboarding triggers based on the candidate\u2019s scorecard and offer signals\u202f\u2014\u202fthe \u201conboarding trigger taxonomy\u201d\u202f[chunk-14].  \n\nThe specific triggers are:\n\n* **Role\u2011risk triggers** (require immediate escalation):  \n  \u2013 Access to PII/PHI  \n  \u2013 Admin network access  \n  \u2013 SOC\u20112 high\u2011impact role  \n  \u2192 These launch a **Restricted onboarding pathway** (security clearance checklist, 1:1 with a Security engineer before day\u202f1)\u202f[chunk-15].\n\n* **Compliance triggers**:  \n  \u2013 EEA employment  \n  \u2013 Contractor\u202fvs\u202femployee conversion  \n  \u2013 Background\u2011check flags  \n  \u2192 These launch an **Extended HR/Legal onboarding** (pre\u2011hire paperwork, local labor\u2011compliance steps)\u202f[chunk-15]."}
*3
