session:5ffad176:history
$870
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The playbook defines two main onboarding trigger categories:\n\n* **Role\u2011risk triggers** \u2013 situations that require immediate escalation, such as access to PII/PHI, admin network access, or a SOC\u202f2 high\u2011impact role. These trigger a **restricted onboarding pathway** that includes a security\u2011clearance checklist and a 1:1 with a Security engineer before the first day\u3010chunk-15\u3011.  \n* **Compliance triggers** \u2013 conditions like EEA employment, contractor\u2011to\u2011employee conversion, or background\u2011check flags. These trigger an **extended HR/Legal onboarding** with pre\u2011hire paperwork and local labor\u2011compliance steps\u3010chunk-15\u3011.  \n\nThe triggers are identified automatically by the People\u202fOps intake system when the candidate signs the offer\u3010chunk-14\u3011."}
