{"role": "assistant", "content": "The document is a pragmatic playbook that provides an SLO\u2011driven fidelity onboarding checklist and guide for bringing customers onto dedicated or private deployments, mapping their latency/availability/correctness SLOs to appropriate fidelity tiers and outlining the required telemetry, operational checks, and step\u2011by\u2011step procedures for commercial and technical leads.\u202f[chunk-2]"}
