$395
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The playbook\u2019s goals are to:\n\n1. Provide a repeatable alignment process that converts customer SLAs into recommended fidelity packages.  \n2. Ensure operational readiness (telemetry, runbooks, rollback) before committing to a fidelity onboarding date.  \n3. Minimize regressions in perceived quality while keeping unit cost under the negotiated budget."}
