$743
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The mitigation strategies in the playbook list the following edge cases:\n\n- **Burst traffic causing cache thrash** \u2013 mitigated by enabling a conservative\u202fkv_cache_policy and raising warm\u2011eligible thresholds.  \n- **Model\u2011variant availability shortage** \u2013 mitigated by using a \u201croute\u2011by\u2011cost\u201d policy to send traffic to an alternate region or a lower\u2011fidelity variant (with explicit consent).  \n- **Regulated workloads** \u2013 mitigated by following the private\u2011deployment checklist, including encryption\u2011key rotation.  \n\nThese are all described in the \u201cCommon edge cases and mitigations\u201d section of the playbook\u3010chunk-23\u3011."}
