{"role": "assistant", "content": "The playbook\u2019s four\u2011week onboarding plan is:\n\n* **Week\u202f0:** Sign the contract and enable sample telemetry.  \n* **Week\u202f1:** Collect telemetry and perform a baseline sweep.  \n* **Week\u202f2:** Deploy to staging and run smoke tests.  \n* **Week\u202f3:** Conduct a canary release and ramp the rollout to\u202f\u2248\u202f50\u202f% of traffic.  \n* **Week\u202f4:** Complete the transition, switch billing over, and enter a 14\u2011day monitoring window.  \n\n[chunk-21]"}
